  "description": "Raised in the same orphanage, Seung-Do did whatever it took to protect sweet, brilliant Ye-Geon...even selling his body to make ends meet. Now that Ye-Gun’s made it to med school, he wants Seung-Do to stop and let him take care of things. But Seung-Do can’t shake the fear that he’s only holding Ye-Geon back. Battling withdrawal and desperate to hide it, he slips back into the world he swore to leave, unaware that Ye-Geon isn’t willing to let go of him so easily. It turns out some bonds are hard to break, no matter how doomed they might seem.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes six side story chapters.*",
